    },
    "summary": "Kubernetes 1.31 utilizes sigs.k8s.io/yaml v1.4.0 across kubectl, the API server, and kubelet.  It decodes YAML manifests to JSON intermediate representation before schema validation, enforcing YAML 1.2 rules.\n",
    "cvd": {
      "has_policy": true,
